      "correctAnswer": "a",
      "explanation": "Subtract equation 1 from equation 2: 2x = 6, so x = 3. Substitute: 9 + 2y = 16, 2y = 7, y = 3.5. Check: 5(3) + 2(3.5) = 15 + 7 = 22."
